# Localization (adding a language):
# - Create BOTH files:
#   - Locales\\<locale>.lua (strings) by copying Locales\\enUS.lua
#   - Locales\\<locale>_Data.lua (checklist) by copying Locales\\enUS_Data.lua
# - In the copies, change the locale code from "enUS" to your locale (example: "deDE") and translate
# - Add BOTH entries here AFTER the enUS files, BEFORE the addon code, so they override enUS
# Example ordering:
#   Locales\\enUS.lua
#   Locales\\enUS_Data.lua
#   Locales\\deDE.lua
#   Locales\\deDE_Data.lua

Locales\\enUS.lua
Locales\\enUS_Data.lua
